        <h1>Kill The MCP</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Production CLIs for APIs Without CLIs</p>
        <p style="color: #666; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
          Automated system generating 5 production-ready command-line tools daily.<br />
          Real TypeScript. Real code. No MCP abstraction needed.
        </p>
        <a href="https://github.com/ktmcp-cli" class="hero-cta">View on GitHub →</a>
      </header>

      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-value">{stats.clis}</div>
          <div class="stat-label">CLIs Published</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
